{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10195","headline":"江湖秋思 · 李嘉佑","name":"江湖秋思","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"趋陪禁掖鴈行随，迁向江潭鹤发垂。\n素浪遥疑八谿水，清枫忽似万年枝。\n嵩南春徧伤魂梦，壶口云深隔路岐。\n共望汉朝多霈泽，苍蝇早晚得先知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10195.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10195","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}